# INVWINM.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the forced
# password change of a new user, left by Log out and taken up again
# after the next login, the local refusals of a repetition that differs
# and of the old password again, then the change, and the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINM.SNP is its snapshot.
T NEWBIE
K TAB
T newbie86
K ENTER
S MUSTCHG
K ESC
S LOGOUT
T newbie86
K ENTER
S AGAIN
T newbie86
K TAB
T Newbie1986
K TAB
T Newbie1987
K ENTER
S NOMATCH
T newbie86
K TAB
T newbie86
K ENTER
S SAME
T Newbie1986
K TAB
T Newbie1986
K ENTER
S CHANGED
K ALT-F X
S GONE
